  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Counter</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>Pixel Counter</h1>\n    <div id=\"count\" class=\"count\" aria-live=\"polite\">0</div>\n    <div class=\"controls\">\n      <button id=\"decrease\" aria-label=\"Decrease count by 1\">−</button>\n      <button id=\"reset\" aria-label=\"Reset count to zero\">Reset</button>\n      <button id=\"increase\" aria-label=\"Increase count by 1\">+</button>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "styles.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1a1a2e;\n  --card: #16213e;\n  --accent: #e94560;\n  --text: #eaeaea;\n  --muted: #a0a0b0;\n}\n\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nbody {\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  color: var(--text);\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n\n.card {\n  background: var(--card);\n  border: 3px solid var(--accent);\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  padding: 32px 24px;\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 360px;\n  text-align: center;\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px var(--bg), 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n}\n\nh1 {\n  font-size: 1.4rem;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n  color: var(--accent);\n}\n\n.count {\n  font-size: 4rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  line-height: 1;\n  margin-bottom: 32px;\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n  word-break: break-all;\n}\n\n.controls {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 12px;\n  justify-content: center;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\nbutton {\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 1.1rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  padding: 12px 20px;\n  min-width: 64px;\n  border: 3px solid var(--accent);\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  background: transparent;\n  color: var(--text);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: background 0.15s, transform 0.05s;\n}\n\nbutton:hover {\n  background: var(--accent);\n  color: var(--bg);\n}\n\nbutton:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid var(--text);\n  outline-offset: 3px;\n}\n\nbutton:active {\n  transform: translateY(2px);\n  background: var(--accent);\n  color: var(--bg);\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 400px) {\n  .count { font-size: 3rem; }\n  button { padding: 10px 14px; min-width: 52px; font-size: 1rem; }\n}\n",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "(function () {\n  'use strict';\n\n  let count = 0;\n  const output = document.getElementById('count');\n  const increaseBtn = document.getElementById('increase');\n  const decreaseBtn = document.getElementById('decrease');\n  const resetBtn = document.getElementById('reset');\n\n  function render() {\n    output.textContent = String(count);\n  }\n\n  increaseBtn.addEventListener('click', function () {\n    count += 1;\n    render();\n  });\n\n  decreaseBtn.addEventListener('click', function () {\n    count -= 1;\n    render();\n  });\n\n  resetBtn.addEventListener('click', function () {\n    count = 0;\n    render();\n  });\n\n  render();\n})();\n",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Counter\n\nA self-contained offline pixel-style counter built with plain HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. No dependencies, no network requests, no storage.\n\n## Features\n\n- Starts at **0** and supports negative numbers.\n- Buttons: **Increase (+1)**, **Decrease (−1)**, and **Reset to zero**.\n- Keyboard-accessible labeled buttons with visible focus, hover, and pressed states.\n- Responsive card layout that works from 360px wide.\n- Cohesive 5-color palette and pixel-inspired styling using only CSS.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — markup and button IDs (`increase`, `decrease`, `reset`, `count`).\n- `styles.css` — pixel theme, layout, and interactive states.\n- `script.js` — counter logic using `addEventListener`.\n\n## Usage\n\nOpen `index.html` in any modern browser. Click the buttons or use Tab and Enter/Space to change the count.\n\n## Constraints\n\n- Total source under 200 lines.\n- No imports, packages, external assets, iframes, or server code.\n- No inline event handlers; all events use `addEventListener`.\n",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
